<!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza a Meia Maratona Roma-Ostia 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 52\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da prova realiza-se no domingo, 28 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida oficial \u00e0s 09:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde \u00e9 o local de partida e a linha de meta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida situa-se em Roma, junto ao PalaEUR (Via Cristoforo Colombo), e a chegada \u00e9 na Rotonda de Ostia (Piazzale Cristoforo Colombo), junto ao mar.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia oficial e o tipo de percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A dist\u00e2ncia \u00e9 de 21,097 km (Meia Maratona oficial e homologada), num percurso linear de asfalto veloz com ligeiro desn\u00edvel descendente favor\u00e1vel rumo \u00e0 costa.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os requisitos de participa\u00e7\u00e3o para atletas estrangeiros?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os participantes devem possuir filia\u00e7\u00e3o federativa v\u00e1lida reconhecida pela World Athletics ou Runcard com o respetivo atestado m\u00e9dico desportivo oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e o regulamento integral est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis no portal oficial da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o em romaostia.it.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Roma (Roma-Ostia) 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-28\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"PalaEUR (Via Cristoforo Colombo, Roma)\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Roma\", \"addressRegion\": \"It\u00e1lia\", \"addressCountry\": \"IT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"RomaOstia ssd \/ RCS Sports & Events \/ GSBRun\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Meia Maratona Roma-Ostia 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 52\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da prova realiza-se no domingo, 28 de fevereiro de 2027, com partida oficial \u00e0s 09:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde \u00e9 o local de partida e a linha de meta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida situa-se em Roma, junto ao PalaEUR (Via Cristoforo Colombo), e a chegada \u00e9 na Rotonda de Ostia (Piazzale Cristoforo Colombo), junto ao mar.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a dist\u00e2ncia oficial e o tipo de percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A dist\u00e2ncia \u00e9 de 21,097 km (Meia Maratona oficial e homologada), num percurso linear de asfalto veloz com ligeiro desn\u00edvel descendente favor\u00e1vel rumo \u00e0 costa.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os requisitos de participa\u00e7\u00e3o para atletas estrangeiros?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os participantes devem possuir filia\u00e7\u00e3o federativa v\u00e1lida reconhecida pela World Athletics ou Runcard com o respetivo atestado m\u00e9dico desportivo oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Questi